# ---- Project documents (N9) ----
!docs/*.md

# ---- Data the code and its tests need from a clone (N12, 6 Oct 2026) ----
# The whitelist above ignores every .json, so these were on the trial box only: a fresh clone
# could not start the API (config/case_types.json) or run the GP suites. All pass the CNIC check.
!config/*.json
!GP/backend/gpf/fixtures/*.json
!GP/backend/tests/ground_truth.json
!GP/agofficegpfund/prototype/sap-samples/*.txt
!GP/prototype
# ---- Rule packs, specimen register, GP corpus, model fingerprints (N12 reopened, 7 Oct 2026) ----
# Still missing from a clone after the lines above: the rules engine found no pack (every
# determination failed), the GP engine did not import. All pass the CNIC check; the corpus and the
# packs are synthetic/reference data, the specimens are the S&GAD register's reference signatures.
# tests/fixtures/ stays ignored: the live-identify test renders its pages itself.
!rules/packs/*.json
!rules/specimens/*.json
!rules/specimens/*.jpg
!GP/gpfund/corpus/*.json
!infra/models/*.fingerprint
# ---- Portal static assets (20 Oct 2026) ----
# Footer.tsx has carried `<img src="./tmc-logo.png">` since the design of 28 Sep 2026 and the
# file was never in the tree, so the portal answered that request with its SPA fallback: HTTP
# 200, content-type text/html, and a broken image in the footer of every page. Vite copies
# portals/public/ verbatim to the site root, so anything put there is by definition meant to be
# published and belongs in the clone -- portals/dist/ stays ignored, being build output.
#
# ** and not * (22 Oct 2026): a single star does not cross a slash, so `portals/public/*` let
# in the three images sitting at the top of public/ and quietly left public/fonts/*.woff2
# ignored. Self-hosted type would have reached the clone as a declaration with nothing behind
# it -- which is precisely the failure the paragraph above is about.
!portals/public/**
